{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and verified a three-member etcd 3.5.17 cluster on node1-node3 with mandatory mutual TLS. node4 provides mTLS administration and current root-only snapshots. The cluster maintained consistent reads and writes during a node3 outage, resynchronized node3 afterward, and persisted successfully through sequential reboots of all four nodes.","actions_performed":["Installed etcd and configured persistent systemd services on node1-node3.","Generated a private CA plus member and administration certificates on node4.","Required client certificates for client and peer traffic; verified certificate-less access is rejected.","Stored /infraset/restore-proof=ready and confirmed replication across members.","Stopped node3, wrote and read data through the remaining quorum, then verified node3 caught up after returning.","Configured /usr/local/bin/etcdctl-mtls on node4 for administration.","Created and validated /var/backups/etcd/etcd-latest.db; final snapshot is revision 4 with 11 keys and mode 600.","Sequentially rebooted node1, node2, node3, and node4, verifying changed boot IDs and complete recovery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Three-member cluster with mTLS-protected client and peer traffic","command_ids":["cmd-ecbaf8f2deb940ef","cmd-b84043f1fbd14367","cmd-57e6f7a78f034b0f"],"summary":"node1-node3 are voting members with HTTPS client and peer URLs. All endpoints are synchronized at Raft index 50; access without a client certificate was rejected."},{"requirement":"Required restore-proof data","command_ids":["cmd-b84043f1fbd14367","cmd-462da5a61ed04a1d","cmd-57e6f7a78f034b0f"],"summary":"/infraset/restore-proof=ready was read from every member and remained present after all restarts."},{"requirement":"Continued consistent reads and writes with one member unavailable, followed by resynchronization","command_ids":["cmd-231b2d8e19b44ada","cmd-7fae79761f524517","cmd-2f3c885372924ca2"],"summary":"node3 was inactive with no listeners while node1 and node2 committed and returned identical data. After returning, node3 contained the outage-time write and matched the cluster Raft index."},{"requirement":"Current recovery snapshot on node4","command_ids":["cmd-57e6f7a78f034b0f"],"summary":"The final snapshot is linked as /var/backups/etcd/etcd-latest.db, validated at revision 4 with 11 keys, and protected as root:root mode 600."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-9bf4c0744be744a6","cmd-f43fc4336d224749","cmd-28a7c73f4724497c","cmd-6e1fa2c08bed4aa3","cmd-b1f1efd5d0764507"],"summary":"Healthy baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 0581c914… to 6efc7bd5…; etcd, data, and full cluster health recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-b3ca13ce3fd64678","cmd-c3e74163c4e0491b","cmd-24603f05ff194e1d","cmd-143aebc16c4c4d2e","cmd-d636b27ca3484478"],"summary":"Healthy baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 83a0a80f… to 0a4782d5…; etcd, data, and full cluster health recovered."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-84242e7da52348c9","cmd-f17f306a39a64fba","cmd-4be195fc72174bb7","cmd-488bc95ac3ed4646","cmd-9355b1ee300643af"],"summary":"Healthy baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 96974ac3… to fdda4a84…; etcd, data, and full cluster health recovered."},{"requirement":"node4 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-3efac580c32a40c9","cmd-8daeddb6b78a4cb7","cmd-3d0910f2151c4027","cmd-462da5a61ed04a1d"],"summary":"Cluster, data, and snapshot baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from be303eb3… to 6141e6de…; administration access and the validated snapshot persisted."}]}
